(Post-2020 deforestation evidence) Tj T*
(JRC GFC2020 is used here as a 2020 forest-baseline layer. Post-2020 disturbance layers) Tj T*
(are intersected with the baseline forest mask to estimate whether forest disturbance) Tj T*
(occurred after the EUDR cut-off date. The reporting period is resolved from the latest) Tj T*
(available evidence datasets and may not equal the current calendar year. These metrics) Tj T*
(do not by themselves establish EUDR deforestation, because EUDR deforestation also) Tj T*
(requires conversion of forest to agricultural use. Agricultural or commodity-conversion) Tj T*
(evidence is therefore reported separately.) Tj T*
